Package: scwbTrajectory
Type: Package
Title: Provisional Trajectory Operations for scworkbench
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Hendrik A.", "de Weerd", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dirkdeweerd.work@gmail.com")
Description: Explicitly activated provisional ABI v3 operation pack containing
    branch comparison, route smoothing, analytical path construction and
    scoring, trajectory-segment composition, and grouped S2 trajectory
    operations for scworkbench.
    It is not a standard-profile dependency.
